# Afternight Games Asset License (ANAL) v1.0

Copyright (c) 2026 Afternight Games.

All rights reserved except as expressly granted under this license.

## 1. Ownership

All original game assets owned by Afternight Games remain the intellectual property of Afternight Games.

This includes original 3D models, textures, animations, sound effects, artwork, and other eligible game assets.

Third-party content is excluded unless Afternight Games has the legal right to sublicense it.

## 2. Personal and Non-Commercial Use

Individuals may use original Afternight Games assets for personal, educational, and non-commercial projects without paying licensing fees.

Users must retain applicable copyright notices and must not sell or redistribute the original assets as standalone asset packs.

## 3. Studio and Commercial Licensing

Any company or game studio wishing to use original Afternight Games assets must obtain a separate asset license.

Commercial use by other individuals or organizations also requires a license.

The standard licensing fee is:

**IDR 20,000,000 per asset per month.**

Each separately identified licensed asset is charged individually.

For example:

- 1 asset: IDR 20,000,000/month
- 2 assets: IDR 40,000,000/month
- 5 assets: IDR 100,000,000/month
- 10 assets: IDR 200,000,000/month

An asset may consist of multiple related files if explicitly defined as one licensed asset in the written agreement.

## 4. Payment and Activation

Licensing fees must be paid in advance.

A commercial asset license becomes active only after payment has been confirmed and the licensing agreement has been accepted by both parties.

The license renews monthly only upon payment or as otherwise specified in the written agreement.

## 5. Attribution

Commercial products using licensed Afternight Games assets must clearly display:

**"Assets licensed from Afternight Games"**

The credit must be reasonably visible in the game's credits, About page, or official website.

## 6. License Expiration

If a license expires without renewal, the licensee must stop further use and distribution of the licensed assets unless a separate written agreement permits otherwise.

The agreement must specify how previously distributed products and existing customer copies are handled after expiration.

## 7. Restrictions

Licensees may not:

- Claim ownership of original Afternight Games assets.
- Resell licensed assets as standalone asset packs without permission.
- Sublicense assets to third parties without written authorization.
- Use Afternight Games branding to imply official endorsement.

## 8. Source Code Licensing

This asset license is separate from the Afternight Games source code license.

Permission to use Operation Ironfall's source code does not automatically grant commercial rights to its game assets.

## 9. Disclaimer

THE ASSETS ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, TO THE EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW.

